Define dm 0.502e12
Define minustwobeta -0.85

Decay Upsilon(4S)
  1.000 B0 anti-B0 VSS_BMIX dm;
Enddecay

Decay B0
  1.000 J/psi K_S0 SSD_CP dm 0.0 1.0 minustwobeta 1.0 0.0 -1.0 0.0;
Enddecay

Decay anti-B0
  1.000 J/psi K_S0 SSD_CP dm 0.0 1.0 minustwobeta 1.0 0.0 -1.0 0.0;
Enddecay

Decay J/psi
  1.000 mu+ mu- PHOTOS VLL;
Enddecay

Decay K_S0
  1.000 pi+ pi- PHSP;
Enddecay

End